  "description": "The Phaetus Rapido UHF (Rapido 2, Ultra High Flow) is designed for extremely high volumetric output, targeting flow rates up to ~75mm³/s. It uses the same 90W ceramic heater plate and bi-metallic heatbreak as the Rapido HF but features a substantially larger melt zone and is optimized for larger nozzle diameters. The standard variant with 104NT thermistor is rated to 290°C; the Plus variant with PT1000 reaches 350°C. Ideal for rapid draft printing and large-format machines.",
